  "body": "This is part of https://github.com/slightlyoff/ServiceWorker/issues/831 to allow module service workers, but I wanted to land it separately from the full solution:\n- It contains good bug fixes for the current spec, where various destinations were not being set correctly or at all.\n- Actually adding the hooks, per my plan there, turns out to be more complicated than I thought, and will need a bit further discussion. So I'd prefer to get these in first so I can focus on the hard stuff independently.\n\nWe can squash these all into a single commit; I left them separate for review.\n",
